{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 42, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps42 (Book II opens) - the thirsting, downcast soul in self-dialogue. nefesh x6 (pants/thirsts/poured out/cast-down x3). arag pant, tsame thirst, refrain (nefesh cast down -> yachal hope -> yadah praise, v5=v11), zakar remember x2, qadar mourning. 4 God-acts (chesed commanded, shakach felt-forgotten, yeshuah salvation x2) = qualifiers. Every candidate roled.",
  "spans": {
    "278508": {"gloss":"pants(soul) v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pant / long (arag - so pants my soul)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"my soul","from":278508,"to":278509,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"pant / long"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"for you, O God","to":278508,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"as a deer pants for streams (simile)","from":278508,"to":278505,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'As a deer pants for flowing streams, so PANTS (arag) my soul for you, O God' — the soul's desperate thirst-longing for God; arag = the panting of a hunted/parched deer, the whole self yearning for God as for water in a drought (the deer-simile is its qualifier)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278509": {"gloss":"soul v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - pants for God)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278509,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David / the psalmist","to":278509,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"which pants for God","from":278509,"to":278508,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'so pants my SOUL (nefesh) for you' — the whole inner self as the seat of the God-thirst; nefesh here the panting self (first of six nefesh, the psalm's central term), the person consumed with longing for God's presence"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278534": {"gloss":"soul v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - thirsts for God)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278534,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278534,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"which thirsts for the living God","from":278534,"to":278535,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My SOUL (nefesh) thirsts for God, for the living God' — the soul's thirst named directly; nefesh (second) the self craving the living God, asking 'when shall I come and appear before God?'"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278535": {"gloss":"thirsts v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"thirst (tsame)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"my soul","from":278535,"to":278534,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"thirst"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"for God, the living God","to":278535,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the soul","from":278535,"to":278534,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My soul THIRSTS (tsame) for God' — the parching desire for God; tsame the literal thirst turned spiritual, the soul dry for the living God as land for water"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278543": {"gloss":"tears v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"tears / weeping (dimah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278543,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"his food day and night","to":278543,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My TEARS (dimah) have been my food day and night' — weeping so constant it replaces bread; dimah (recurs Ps39:12) the tears that feed the grief while the foes taunt 'Where is your God?'"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278553": {"gloss":"remember v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"remember (zakar - these things)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278553,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"remember"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the past worship in the throng","to":278553,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"pouring out his soul","from":278553,"to":278555,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'These things I REMEMBER (zakar), as I pour out my soul: how I would go with the throng to the house of God' — memory of past worship deepening present grief; zakar (first of two, v4,v6) the recollection of festal joy that now pains the exile"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278555": {"gloss":"soul v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - pour out my soul)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278555,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278555,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"pour out","to":278555,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"poured out in remembrance","from":278555,"to":278553,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'as I pour out my SOUL (nefesh)' — the self emptied out in grief and memory; nefesh (third) poured out like water, the total unburdening of the sorrowing self"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278562": {"gloss":"glad v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glad shouts / ringing joy (rinnah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the festal throng (remembered)","to":278562,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with songs of thanksgiving","from":278562,"to":278564,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with GLAD shouts (rinnah) and songs of praise, a multitude keeping festival' — the remembered joy of temple worship; rinnah (recurs Ps30:5) the ringing gladness of the pilgrim throng, now only a painful memory"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278564": {"gloss":"songs v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"thanksgiving / songs of praise (todah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the festal throng","to":278564,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with glad shouts","from":278564,"to":278562,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and SONGS of praise (todah)' — the thanksgiving of the remembered festival; todah (recurs Ps26:7) the thank-songs of the worshipping multitude, the lost joy the exile longs to rejoin"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278569": {"gloss":"soul v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - cast down)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278569,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (addressing his own soul)","to":278569,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"cast down and in turmoil","from":278569,"to":278568,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"summoned to hope","from":278569,"to":278572,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Why are you cast down, O my SOUL (nefesh), and why in turmoil within me?' — the self in dialogue with itself; nefesh (fourth) the dejected soul the psalmist interrogates and exhorts, the refrain that structures the psalm (v5=v11) — self-counsel against despair"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278572": {"gloss":"Hope v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hope / wait (yachal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the soul (self-commanded)","from":278572,"to":278569,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hope"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"in God","to":278572,"res":"inferred"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"God his salvation, the object of hope (v5)","from":278572,"to":278576,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the soul commanded to it","from":278572,"to":278569,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'HOPE (yachal) in God; for I shall again praise him' — the self-command to hope against dejection; yachal (recurs Ps33,38) the deliberate turning of the downcast soul toward God, its salvation (the qualifier), the discipline of hope"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278575": {"gloss":"praise v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"praise / give thanks (yadah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278575,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"praise (again)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God his salvation","to":278575,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'for I shall again PRAISE (yadah) him, my salvation and my God' — the confident anticipation of renewed praise; yadah the thanksgiving the hoping soul is sure it will offer once more, faith reaching past present grief"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278578": {"gloss":"soul v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - cast down within me)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278578,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278578,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"cast down","from":278578,"to":278579,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"therefore he remembers God from afar","from":278578,"to":278582,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My SOUL (nefesh) is cast down within me; therefore I remember you' — the dejection that drives him back to God-remembrance; nefesh (fifth) cast down, its very lowness turning him to recall God from the far country (Jordan, Hermon, Mizar)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278582": {"gloss":"remember v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"remember (zakar - you, from afar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278582,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"remember"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God (you)","to":278582,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"from the land of Jordan and Hermon","to":278582,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"driven by the cast-down soul","from":278582,"to":278578,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'therefore I REMEMBER (zakar) you from the land of Jordan' — memory turned Godward from exile; zakar (second, contrast v4's painful memory of worship) here the redemptive remembering of God himself from the far-off land, hope's anchor in dejection"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278608": {"gloss":"prayer v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"prayer (tefillah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278608,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the God of my life","to":278608,"res":"inferred"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"grounded by God's steadfast love commanded by day (v8)","from":278608,"to":278605,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"at night, a song","to":278608,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'at night his song is with me, a PRAYER (tefillah) to the God of my life' — the night-prayer sustained by God's daytime love; tefillah the song-prayer of the sufferer, grounded in the chesed God commands by day (the qualifier)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278619": {"gloss":"mourning v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"mourn / go about darkly (qadar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278619,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"mourn"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the felt divine forgetting + enemy oppression (v9)","from":278619,"to":278616,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"because of the enemy's oppression","to":278619,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Why do I go MOURNING (qadar) because of the oppression of the enemy?' — the dark grief of feeling forgotten by God; qadar (recurs Ps35:14, 38:6) the mourning-blackness, its cause the felt divine forgetting (v9 qualifier) and the foe's oppression"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278514": {"gloss":"taunt v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"taunt / reproach (charaph)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the adversaries","to":278514,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"taunt"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278514,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"like a deadly wound in the bones","to":278514,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my adversaries TAUNT (charaph) me... Where is your God?' — the reproach that wounds like a mortal blow to the bones; charaph the mocking of the foes whose 'Where is your God?' assaults the very ground of faith"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278524": {"gloss":"soul v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul (nefesh - cast down, refrain)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":278524,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278524,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"cast down and in turmoil","from":278524,"to":278523,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"summoned to hope","from":278524,"to":278527,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Why are you cast down, O my SOUL (nefesh)?' — the refrain repeated (v5) sealing the psalm; nefesh (sixth) the dejected soul again exhorted to hope, the self-counsel that holds despair and faith together, unresolved but hoping"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278527": {"gloss":"Hope v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hope / wait (yachal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the soul (self-commanded)","from":278527,"to":278524,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hope"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"in God","to":278527,"res":"inferred"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"God his salvation, the object of hope (v11)","from":278527,"to":278531,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the soul commanded to it","from":278527,"to":278524,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'HOPE (yachal) in God' (refrain) — the reiterated command to hope; yachal repeated (v5), the disciplined hope that answers the recurring dejection, the psalm's closing counsel to the self"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278530": {"gloss":"praise v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"praise / give thanks (yadah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278530,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"praise (again)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God his salvation","to":278530,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'for I shall again PRAISE (yadah) him, my salvation and my God' (refrain) — the sure hope of renewed thanksgiving; yadah repeated (v5), the anticipated praise that faith holds onto in the dark, the psalm ending on hope not resolution"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278505": {"gloss":"pants(deer) v1 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pant / long (arag - as a deer)"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"the deer-simile intensifying the soul's panting (278508)","from":278505,"to":278508,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1: 'As a DEER PANTS (arag) for flowing streams' - the simile of the parched deer that qualifies the soul's own panting (278508); the manner/image of the longing. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278568": {"gloss":"cast v5 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be cast down / bowed (shachach)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the downcast state of the soul (278569)","from":278568,"to":278569,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v5: 'why are you CAST DOWN (shachach), O my soul' - the dejection that is the state of the soul (278569); qualifies the soul's downcastness. Qualifier (the soul's state)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278579": {"gloss":"cast v6 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be cast down (shachach)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the downcast state of the soul (278578)","from":278579,"to":278578,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v6: 'My soul is CAST DOWN (shachach) within me' - the dejection qualifying the soul (278578); its downcast state that drives him to remember God. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278523": {"gloss":"cast v11 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be cast down (shachach)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the downcast state of the soul (278524)","from":278523,"to":278524,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v11: 'why are you CAST DOWN (shachach), O my soul' (refrain) - the dejection qualifying the soul (278524). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278576": {"gloss":"salvation v5 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yeshuah - God is my salvation)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the salvation the soul hopes in / praises (v5)","from":278576,"to":278572,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v5 QUALIFIER (God's salvation): 'I shall again praise him, my SALVATION (yeshuah) and my God' - God as salvation is not a human IB char; it is the object of the soul's hope and praise (278572). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278531": {"gloss":"salvation v11 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yeshuah - God is my salvation)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the salvation the soul hopes in / praises (v11)","from":278531,"to":278527,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v11 QUALIFIER (God's salvation, refrain): 'my SALVATION (yeshuah) and my God' - God as salvation is not a human IB char; the object of the soul's hope and praise (278527). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278605": {"gloss":"steadfast love v8 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed - God commands his)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"grounds David's night-prayer (v8)","from":278605,"to":278608,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v8 QUALIFIER (God's chesed): 'By day the LORD commands his STEADFAST LOVE (chesed)' - God's covenant love is not a human IB char; it is the source sustaining David's night-song and prayer (278608). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278616": {"gloss":"forgotten v9 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"forget (shakach - God's, felt/questioned)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the felt divine forgetting that grounds David's mourning (v9)","from":278616,"to":278619,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v9 QUALIFIER (God's act, felt): 'Why have you FORGOTTEN (shakach) me?' - God's (felt) forgetting is not a human IB char; it is the source of David's mourning (278619) - the divine action he questions, grounding his grief. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278591": {"gloss":"calls v7 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"call (qara - deep calls to deep)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v7: 'DEEP CALLS (qara) to deep at the roar of your waterfalls; all your breakers have gone over me' - the image of overwhelming waters (trouble surging over him); a cosmic-metaphor of being engulfed, not a human inner operation. Standalone (grounds the sense of being overwhelmed)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
